---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Calm the exact To do or Updates revision you opened. Get the row id, account_id and seen_revision from `todo` or `updates --format json`

Usage: mxr modes seen [OPTIONS] --account <ACCOUNT> --revision <REVISION> <MODE> <ROW_ID>

Arguments:
  <MODE>    [possible values: todo, updates]
  <ROW_ID>

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>
      --revision <REVISION>
      --dry-run
      --format <FORMAT>      [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help                 Print help
